 $$\int_{-\pi}^{\pi}e^{-x\,u\,i}e^{R\,e^{\,u\,i}}du$$ 
 where  $x,R>0$  in terms of elemental or special functions. 
 A first attempt 
 $$\int_{-\pi}^{\pi}e^{-x\,u\,i}e^{R\,e^{\,u\,i}}du=-i\,\int_Cz^{-x-1}\,e^{R\,z}\,dz$$ 
 with  $C$  the unit circle. 
