\\[5mm] = &\
\bbx{2\expo{-R}\,{\sin\pars{\pi x} \over x} +
2R^{x}\,{\sin\pars{\pi x} \over x}
\bracks{\Gamma\pars{-x + 1} - \Gamma\pars{-x + 1,R}}} \\ &
\end{align} 
 $\ds{\Gamma\pars{\cdots}\ \mbox{and}\
\Gamma\pars{\cdots,\cdots}}$  are the
 Gamma and Incomplete Gamma Functions , respectively. 
