{"input_text": "Question: Consider
 \begin{equation}\label{1}
\partial^2_t\phi-\partial^2_x\phi=\phi -\phi^3,\: \ (x,t) \in \Bbb{R}\times \Bbb{R} \tag{1}
\end{equation} 
the  $\phi^4$  model, often used
